# Slide Design System - Clinical Trials Deck

## Color System

| Color | Hex | Usage | Rule |
|-------|-----|-------|------|
| **Navy** | #1A2B49 | H1, H3, structure | Headlines only |
| **Teal** | #2C7873 | Subtitles, bullets, arrows | Secondary elements |
| **Coral** | #E85D75 | Numbers ONLY | All statistics |
| **Warm Gray** | #F5F5F5 | Box backgrounds | Never for text |
| **Dark Gray** | #333333 | Body text | All paragraphs/lists |
| **White** | #FFFFFF | Slide backgrounds, text on navy | - |

**Critical Rule**: Coral = numbers only. Creates instant data scanning.

---

## Typography

**Font**: Inter (sans-serif only)

```css
--font-size-hero: 56px      /* Big numbers: $40K, $30M */
--font-size-h1: 42px        /* Slide titles (38px if tight) */
--font-size-h3: 22px        /* Box titles (18-19px if tight) */
--font-size-body: 17px      /* Standard text (14-15px if tight) */
--font-size-small: 15px     /* Details */

--font-weight-bold: 700     /* Headlines, numbers */
--font-weight-semibold: 600 /* Labels, subtitles */
--font-weight-normal: 400   /* Body text */
```

**Line Height**:
- Headlines: 1.2
- Body text: 1.4
- Tight content: 1.3

---

## Spacing

```css
--spacing-sm: 12-16px    /* Item margins */
--spacing-md: 18-24px    /* Box padding */
--spacing-lg: 28-32px    /* Section gaps */
--slide-padding: 36-40px /* All slides */
```

**Grid Gaps**: 12-16px (tight), 24-28px (normal)

