## Components

### Data Card (White)
```css
background: #FFFFFF;
border-left: 4px solid #E85D75;
padding: 24px;
border-radius: 8px;
box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
```

### Info Box (Gray)
```css
background: #F5F5F5;
padding: 18-24px;
border-radius: 8px;
/* Optional: border-left: 3px solid #E85D75; */
```

### Insight Box (Navy)
```css
background: #1A2B49;
padding: 14-18px;
border-radius: 8px;
color: #FFFFFF;
text-align: center;
font-weight: 600;
```

### Lists
```css
ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
li { 
  padding-left: 18-20px; 
  margin-bottom: 9-14px;
  position: relative;
}
li:before { 
  content: "•"; 
  color: #2C7873; 
  position: absolute; 
  left: 0;
  font-weight: 700;
}
```
**Alternative bullet**: Use "✓" for benefits/investments

### Inline Stats
```html
<span class="stat">35-61%</span>
```
```css
.stat { color: #E85D75; font-weight: 700; }
```

