## Critical Rules

1. **All text must be in `<p>`, `<h1-h6>`, `<ul>`, or `<ol>` tags** (html2pptx requirement)
2. **Backgrounds/borders only on `<div>`**, not text elements
3. **Coral = numbers only** (creates scanning pattern)
4. **Navy backgrounds = emphasis boxes only** (bottom of slides)
5. **Minimum 36px slide padding** (0.5" from edges)
6. **Border-left: 3-4px coral** (for emphasis boxes only)
7. **Border-radius: 6-8px** (all boxes)
8. **Never use default list styling** (always custom with li:before)

---

## Scaling for Dense Content

| Element | Normal | Tight | Critical |
|---------|--------|-------|----------|
| H1 | 42px | 38px | 36px |
| H3 | 22px | 18-19px | 17-18px |
| Body | 17px | 14-15px | 13-14px |
| Padding | 40px | 36px | 32px |

**Rule**: Scale all elements proportionally. Don't go below Critical.

---

## Quality Checklist

- [ ] Title: 42px, navy, 700
- [ ] Numbers: coral, 700
- [ ] Body: dark gray, 400
- [ ] Boxes: warm gray background
- [ ] Custom bullets: teal via li:before
- [ ] Padding: 36-40px all edges
- [ ] Text in proper tags (no bare divs)
- [ ] Grid gaps consistent
- [ ] No overflow (check thumbnail)

---

## Anti-Patterns

❌ Coral on non-numbers  
❌ Multiple accent colors  
❌ Icons/illustrations  
❌ Centered body text  
❌ Default HTML styling  
❌ <36px edge padding  
❌ Text in unwrapped divs  
❌ Mixed font families  



